&Q000519

{1 = 1-13}
9=1.	May @wDN{Lugal-Šubur} place on your head the desert crown of kingship! 
13=2.	May @wDN{Enki}, the lord of life, …… life, and in the @wTN{E-unir}, 
17=3.	the house of the plans of heaven and earth which rides upon all the divine powers, 
21=4.	may he cover your priestly headdress in awe and splendour! 
25=5.	May he make the divine powers of kingship resplendent for you, 
29=6.	and fit you up forever with the plans appropriate to the rank of @fsux{en} priest! 
33=7.	May he gently recite for you live-giving incantations, bestowing in addition a long-lived destiny; 
37=8.	may the uttering of your name delight @wDN{Enki} as much as the uttering of his own name! 
41=9.	May he reward you with wisdom and intelligence! 
45=10.	May your royal name be as something unchangeable! 
49=11.	May Father @wDN{Enki} prolong the years of your life, 
53=12.	and may he grant you lordship over every one of the foreign lands. 
57=13.	O @wRN{Ḫammu-rābi}, my king! 
